{"type": "text", "timestamp": 1793762387187, "sessionID": "ses_e5b6e529dffeic45xLwJISZYgm", "part": {"id": "prt_1a491db66001S4v8NA4PC2CY6p", "messageID": "msg_1a491d52d001JhueN76mnaVRdg", "sessionID": "ses_e5b6e529dffeic45xLwJISZYgm", "type": "text", "text": "**The available architecture data does not specify how often `RenewalsWorker` re-bills subscriptions.**\n\nThe only recorded configuration key for `RenewalsWorker` is `AUTH_HOLD_MINUTES`, which controls how long a renewal authorization is held before capture\u2014not the re-billing frequency. Its numeric value is not provided.\n\n`RenewalsWorker` depends on `BillingService` and calls `PaymentsAPI`, exposed by `PaymentsService`. No configuration keys are recorded for `BillingService` that establish a renewal schedule.\n\nSo the re-billing cadence cannot be determined from these records.", "time": {"start": 1793762384742, "end": 1793762387185}, "metadata": {"openai": {"itemId": "msg_057c4b1ee8fd4c2a016aeaa450b00c87d1a89ac0e7b00ecaee", "phase": "final_answer"}}}}
